{%- comment -%}
Golden Token for the refer a friend page: the photographed token (assets/golden-token-240.webp, or the 640px
golden-token.webp when large: true). outline: true draws a dashed ring instead (a token still to collect).
size: display size in px (default 34). Decorative: alt is empty, callers add text alongside.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign token_size = size | default: 34 -%}
{%- if outline -%}
<span class="referral-token referral-token--outline" style="--token-size: {{ token_size }}px;"></span>
{%- else -%}
{%- if large -%}{%- assign token_file = 'golden-token.webp' -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign token_file = 'golden-token-240.webp' -%}{%- endif -%}
<img class="referral-token" src="{{ token_file | asset_url }}" width="{{ token_size }}" height="{{ token_size }}" alt="" style="--token-size: {{ token_size }}px;">
{%- endif -%}
